      "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR refactors the homepage commit search flow by extracting shared types/utilities into dedicated modules and splitting the monolithic `app/page.tsx` UI into smaller home-specific helpers/components, aiming to improve maintainability and reduce test noise.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces `app/commitTypes.ts` and updates imports to centralize `CommitInfo`/`CommitData`.\n- Extracts homepage search utilities (analytics, recent searches, URL sharing, result messaging, execution) into `app/home/*`.\n- Breaks homepage UI into focused components (`SearchForm`, `SearchResults`, `SearchErrorState`, `SearchShortcutSection`) and adjusts tests accordingly.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 20 out of 20 changed files in this pull request and generated 6 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| components/FirstCommitDisplay.tsx | Simplifies commit message parsing into subject/body variables. |\r\n| components/FirstCommitDisplay.test.tsx | Updates type import to use `app/commitTypes`. |\r\n| app/page.tsx | Refactors homepage into smaller components and delegates search logic to `app/home/*`. |\r\n| app/page.test.tsx | Updates clipboard/storage failure tests to use `DOMException`. |\r\n| app/layout.test.tsx | Switches to static markup rendering to avoid layout-test warning/noise. |\r\n| app/home/analytics.ts | Adds analytics wrapper module for tracking events. |\r\n| app/home/browserErrors.ts | Centralizes “recoverable browser error” checks for storage/clipboard. |\r\n| app/home/constants.ts | Extracts recent-search and example-username constants. |\r\n| app/home/recentSearches.ts | Extracts localStorage recent-search read/write/clear helpers. |\r\n| app/home/resultMessages.ts | Extracts commit-search result messaging and retry/empty helpers. |\r\n| app/home/searchExecution.ts | Extracts normalized search execution + recent-search persistence. |\r\n| app/home/sharedSearch.ts | Extracts shared URL helpers + share-text builder + repo URL helper. |\r\n| app/home/SearchErrorState.tsx | New component for rendering error/empty states and retry/reset actions. |\r\n| app/home/SearchForm.tsx | New component encapsulating the homepage search form + validation UI. |\r\n| app/home/SearchResults.tsx | New component encapsulating the successful results UI and commit list. |\r\n| app/home/SearchShortcutSection.tsx | New reusable section for “Recent searches” / “Examples” shortcut buttons. |\r\n| app/commitTypes.ts | New shared type module for commit search data structures. |\r\n| app/commitSearchCache.ts | Updates cached result type import to use `app/commitTypes`. |\r\n| app/commitSearchCache.test.ts | Updates cached result type import to use `app/commitTypes`. |\r\n| app/actions.ts | Removes in-file type definitions and imports types from `app/commitTypes`; minor formatting cleanup. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/scottdensmore/my-first-commit/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>."
