    "body": "`trackAppEvent` now calls `track()` without guarding against runtime exceptions. Previously analytics failures were explicitly swallowed so they could not interrupt the search flow; consider restoring a try/catch (or a safe no-op fallback) so a tracking failure can’t break user interactions.\n",
